  "note": "Election of the Newcastle Urban Council, polled Wednesday 21 May 1958 (Belfast News-Letter, 22 May 1958, p. 2). Seventeen nominations for nine seats. The report prints the nine elected and the eight not elected (A. W. Ferguson and J. M'Kibben tied at 502), all with their votes.",
